arte de la junta directiva.',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:39'),(1208,'Además en EIF contribuimos económicamente a través de una cuota como asociados.',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:39'),(1209,'https://www.etuc.org/en',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:41'),(1210,'Ferpa',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:41'),(1211,'FERPA has grown from the structure of the European Trade Union Confederation (ETUC) and works actively to shape European Union legislation and policies through direct lobbying of different European institutions. It wants a procedure to be set up for the European Commission to consult the most representative organisations of retired and elderly people so that their voice can be heard. The Federation’s member organisations also lobby their national governments, especially ahead of European Council meetings whose agendas include issues of concern to retired and elderly people.',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:41'),(1212,'https://ferpa.org/about-us/',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:41'),(1213,'Confindustria (associazione italiana imprese manifatturiere)',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1214,'FederUnacoma aderisce in Europa a:',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1215,'CEMA - associazione europea costruttori macchine per agricoltura',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1216,'EGMF - associazione europea costruttori macchine per giardinaggio',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1217,'EUROMOT - associazione europea dei costruttori di motori a combustione interna',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1218,'ORGALIM- associazione europea industrie ingegneristiche e tecnologiche (tramite CEMA)',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1219,'A livello mondiale, FederUnacoma è membra di Agrievolution (www.agrievolution.com)',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1220,'DigitalEurope','64270747023-20','2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1221,'Alliance for IoT and Edge Computing Innovation (AIOTI)',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1222,'European Industrial Research Management Association (EIRMA)',NULL,'2025-05-16 14:48:43'),(1223,'European Factories of the Future Research Association (EFFRA)