-05-16 14:48:49'),(2359,'* Prácticas y movilidad de estudiantes','2025-05-16 14:48:49'),(2360,'* Sostenibilidad ambiental','2025-05-16 14:48:49'),(2361,'Politiche sanitarie, Progetti di prevenzione comunitaria in merito alla salute orale delle popolazioni, Riconoscimento della professione di igienista dentale nell\'ambito dei paesi delle Unione Europea','2025-05-16 14:48:50'),(2362,'Harmonised indirect taxation, as VAT and excise taxes, industry regulations concerning excise goods, customs system and procedure (ex CN classification of goods, etc)','2025-05-16 14:48:50'),(2363,'- Amendments to Directive 92/83/EC','2025-05-16 14:48:50'),(2364,'- Amendments to Directive 2011/64/EU','2025-05-16 14:48:50'),(2365,'Regulations on food additives','2025-05-16 14:48:51'),(2366,'HSBC engages on a broad range of financial services and business policy proposals and plays an active role in discussions with a wide range stakeholders on issues that directly affect the bank, its customers and the wider economy, including financial sector and markets regulation, trade policy, SMEs, digital, financial crime, sustainable finance and infrastructure','2025-05-16 14:48:52'),(2367,'Toute réglementation en lien avec la défense des animaux (agriculture, écologie, recherche)','2025-05-16 14:48:54');
